# Browser calls stay same-origin by default; Vite proxies /api to this v0.4
# service in development. Set this only when the browser can reach the service
# directly (for example, a deployed API origin with CORS configured).
VITE_MANAI_API_URL=

# Vite reads non-VITE variables from the shell, not this file. Examples:
#   $env:MANAI_V04_URL='http://127.0.0.1:8001'
#   npm run dev
# MANAI_V04_URL takes precedence over the legacy MANAI_ANALYSIS_URL.
